  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"124\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"124\">Partner with Just Ink and Toner Store</strong></p><p data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"396\">At <strong data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"157\">Just Ink and Toner Store</strong>, we are committed to delivering <strong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"275\">premium-quality U.S. remanufactured and original printer ink and toner cartridges</strong> at competitive prices. Our products are carefully sourced to ensure reliability, performance, and customer satisfaction.</p><p data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"613\">We are pleased to offer an <strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"456\">affiliate commission of 15%</strong> on all sales generated through your referrals. This is an excellent opportunity to earn while promoting high-demand office supplies from a trusted supplier.</p><p data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"646\"><strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"646\">Commission &amp; Payment Terms:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"878\"><li data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"739\"><p data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"739\">You will earn <strong data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"681\">15% commission</strong> on the total value of each successful order you bring in.</p></li><li data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"878\"><p data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"878\"><strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"779\">Payments are processed via PayPal</strong> and will be issued <strong data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"831\">30 days after the order date</strong> to allow for processing and potential returns.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"1076\">We value our partners and strive to build long-term, mutually beneficial relationships. If you have any questions or would like marketing materials to support your efforts, feel free to reach out.</p><p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1114\">We look forward to working with you!</p></div>",
